text:
I was a swimmer (lane #5);
I have a playlist of peruvian music;
I occasionally play guitar and piano;
I appreciate visiting art galleries, unexpected findings occur;
I got curious on physical biology after: goodwin, bejan, leibler;
I enjoy reading dialectical materialism: politzer, fromm, engels;
I love reading poetic literature: oswaldo reynoso, martin adan;
I like listening to radiohead, apparat, niños sin smartphones;
I also like listening to domΔ and the peruvian avant trap!
I am learning to design accessible outputs.

